# {{ name }}

Applet id: `{{ id }}`.

Requires Go. `just lint` also needs `golangci-lint`. The SDK is the `sdk-go` module; run `go mod tidy` once to fetch it.

Run `just dev`: it builds the binary, loads `devconfig.toml` and attaches the
applet with its options and env. Options edits update it; source edits rebuild and restart it.

The justfile wraps the whole loop: `just dev`, `just test`, `just lint`, `just package`,
`just install`.

Add `center = ["{{ id }}"]` to a panel's applet zone.
